  THE COMPACT-SHELL RESIDUAL AT PROTACTINIUM, ON THE RECORD'S OWN SECOND-ORDER INSTRUMENT

  E2_ent = second-order pair correlation of the entrant, on the chain's own local orbitals;
  E2_ent_sib is the SAME-SHELL (sibling) part, which a removal destroys and which HF cannot carry.

